{"id":32463322602,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHjvb96g","head_branch":"fix/2.41-enrollment-has-events-preheat","head_sha":"0fa144520f1235a640488d81f272d5b40f50e8cc","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55811,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: skip enrollment-has-events preheat query for enrollments not in the payload","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":88001063120,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAUfUWo0A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602","pull_requests":[{"id":4330122859,"number":24936,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/24936","head":{"ref":"fix/2.41-enrollment-has-events-preheat","sha":"0fa144520f1235a640488d81f272d5b40f50e8cc","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.41","sha":"7b5e54c84a3d834e9c95e64c833d0c107ce9daef","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-08-21T08:28:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T08:44:58Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-21T08:28:12Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/88001063120","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32463322602/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: skip enrollment-has-events preheat query for enrollments not in the payload\n\nEnrollmentsWithAtLeastOneEventSupplier sourced its ids from preheat.getEnrollments()\n(everything preheated) instead of the import payload. On 2.41, single-event programs\ndon't have their own storage split from tracker events yet, so EnrollmentSupplier\nunconditionally preheats a synthetic Enrollment for every WITHOUT_REGISTRATION program\ntouched by an import - even a bare {\"events\": [...]} payload with no enrollments at all.\nThat made this supplier run its \"does this enrollment have a non-deleted event\" query on\nevery single-event import, discovered while JProfiler-tracing a Myanmar events tracker\nimport: 24.8ms/request, 47.7% of all JDBC time in that trace.\n\nThe result has exactly one reader: SecurityOwnershipValidator.enrollmentHasEvents(), a\nValidator\u003cEnrollment\u003e that only runs for Enrollment objects actually in the payload, and\nonly checks this when deleting one. A pure event import never reaches it, so the query's\nresult was discarded every time - pure dead work.\n\nSource the ids from trackerObjects.getEnrollments() (the actual payload) instead. For a\nsingle-event-only import that list is empty, so the existing `if (!ids.isEmpty())` guard\nnow skips the query entirely; for real tracker imports it also narrows correctly to just\nthe enrollments being submitted, rather than every enrollment preheat happens to hold.\n\nMaster has a narrower echo of the same sourcing issue (EnrollmentsWithAtLeastOneEventSupplier\nalso reads preheat.getEnrollments() there), but master's single events don't preheat any\nenrollment at all - there's no EnrollmentSupplier there anymore - so the single-event dead-\nwork trigger this fixes is 2.41-specific. Left master alone per user's choice to scope this\n2.41-only for now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"0fa144520f1235a640488d81f272d5b40f50e8cc","tree_id":"62e9f8cd7ab35976401ba550aa780d7b735d1196","timestamp":"2026-08-21T08:18:02Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/comments{/number}","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/commits{/sha}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/compar